# Windsurf Cascade Rules

Refer to AGENTS.md for architecture and domain guidelines.

## Safety Rules
- Do NOT commit or push to Git without explicit developer permission.
- Always verify code with `go vet ./...` and `go test -count=1 ./...`.

## Architecture Rules
- Use go-chi/chi/v5 router.
- Clean Architecture per module: delivery -> usecase -> repository -> domain.
- Do not couple usecases to HTTP or SQL drivers directly; rely on interfaces.
- Use logos logger and bunker errors.
